CONCURRENCY AND DOUBLE-ACTION SAFETY: 61 passed, 0 failed
NOT VERIFIED — EXTERNAL ENVIRONMENT REQUIRED: that the LIVE backend honours the Idempotency-Key header and returns 409 on a stale base revision needs egress to the deployment (blocked here, 403). This suite proves the page-side contract.
